sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant API as API (Go · services/api)
  participant CACHE as Caché CIDR (RAM 15s)
  participant PG as PostgreSQL 16

  C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth {username, password}
  API->>CACHE: IsIPAllowed(client_ip)
  alt Cache miss
    CACHE->>PG: SELECT ip FROM allowed_ips WHERE is_active = TRUE
    PG-->>CACHE: Lista IPs / CIDR
  end
  API->>PG: SELECT * FROM "user" WHERE username = $1
  PG-->>API: User (hash bcrypt, role, is_active)
  API->>API: bcrypt.CompareHashAndPassword + verifica is_active
  API->>API: Firma JWT HS256 (sub=user.id, exp=24h)
  API-->>C: 200 {access_token, role, user}

  C->>API: GET /api/v1/task o GET /api/v1/report/excel (Bearer JWT)
  API->>CACHE: IsIPAllowed(client_ip)
  API->>API: Valida firma HS256, expiración y is_active
  API->>PG: Resuelve alcance por rol (admin: todos | encargado: propios + encargado_users | user: propios)
  PG-->>API: Registros filtrados por alcance
  API-->>C: 200 JSON / Excel .xlsx (o 403 si excede alcance)
